Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":703,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1904175,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284683,"Name":"NG1515","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284683.jpg?_r=1441394632","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1441395014,"LastPoster":{"Id":284683,"Name":"NG1515","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284683.jpg?_r=1441394632","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1904175,"PostDate":1441395014,"PostContent":"Hey there ladies! \u00a0 I'm new on this site and I found it because of the amazing topic trend on her...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nelsygomez15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.249.196","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441393839,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284683.jpg?_r=1441394632","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NG1515","Id":284683,"Name":"NG1515","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.54.249.196","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca5fc19ceb86a518d0f87c4f3bc0d768","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hey there ladies!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I&#039;m new on this site and I found it because of the amazing topic trend on here regarding Paradisus La Perla in Playa del Carmen. &amp;nbsp;Our wedding is scheduled for April 16, 2016 and we booked the venue (and signed a contract) back in May of this year. &amp;nbsp;Well we just found out that somehow the resort double booked our ceremony venue and unilaterally was going to move us to a different venue location that we did not select, nor did we want to utilize for the ceremony. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Suffice it to say, we are very upset, disappointed, and frankly, insulted by how cavalier they were about the change. &amp;nbsp;It was our understanding that they never host two weddings at the same time. &amp;nbsp;We are now being left with the option of either using the Gazebo to host our 80-100 guest wedding on the 16th while another wedding is going on at our original ceremony venue, move the date of the wedding to the following day (keeping in mind that guests have already booked rooms, we have already sent save the dates and had our invitations printed) in order to use the bridge while a potential corporate event is going on behind us at Gabi Club, or pursue legal action for breach of contract. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;It would be great to know if anyone else has had similar issues with the Romance Department and how it was resolved. &amp;nbsp;This has been a very stressful and upsetting week to say the least!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904175,"PostDate":1441395014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hey there ladies!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I'm new on this site and I found it because of the amazing topic trend on here regarding Paradisus La Perla in Playa del Carmen. \u00a0Our wedding is scheduled for April 16, 2016 and we booked the venue (and signed a contract) back in May of this year. \u00a0Well we just found out that somehow the resort double booked our ceremony venue and unilaterally was going to move us to a different venue location that we did not select, nor did we want to utilize for the ceremony. \u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Suffice it to say, we are very upset, disappointed, and frankly, insulted by how cavalier they were about the change. \u00a0It was our understanding that they never host two weddings at the same time. \u00a0We are now being left with the option of either using the Gazebo to host our 80-100 guest wedding on the 16th while another wedding is going on at our original ceremony venue, move the date of the wedding to the following day (keeping in mind that guests have already booked rooms, we have already sent save the dates and had our invitations printed) in order to use the bridge while a potential corporate event is going on behind us at Gabi Club, or pursue legal action for breach of contract. \u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">It would be great to know if anyone else has had similar issues with the Romance Department and how it was resolved. \u00a0This has been a very stressful and upsetting week to say the least!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nelsygomez15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.249.196","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441393839,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284683.jpg?_r=1441394632","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NG1515","Id":284683,"Name":"NG1515","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.99.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dfb289c0bd53467ba7dba5290304e97","RawContent":"That is not right. I would tell them if i have to change my location after you only host one wedding at a time and it seems that is not true. Then they need to give you a big discount on your wedding package. After you have already sent you invites out. And people have booked. Don&#039;t change your plans just because the resort made a mistake. Make them pay for it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904176,"PostDate":1441398680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That is not right. I would tell them if i have to change my location after you only host one wedding at a time and it seems that is not true. Then they need to give you a big discount on your wedding package. After you have already sent you invites out. And people have booked. Don't change your plans just because the resort made a mistake. Make them pay for it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440294410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"356f18cc9d6a1a719bab0b0141574e56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, NG1515 and Congrats on your upcoming dw next April!!! You&#039;ll find lots of great resources here for ideas, advice, suggestions and support, so well done on joining up :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope you find a great resolution for your conflict that turns out to be a win\/win all around.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best with your plans, and that it turns out to be just as Awesome as you want it to be - cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....for some added inspiration, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera - to ramp up your creativity....enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....taken from one of our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151786897419487.1073741864.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Playa del Carmen TTD Albums: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1149138_10151786898754487_1301415691_o.jpg\" alt=\"1149138_10151786898754487_1301415691_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1233076_10151786899149487_813971599_o.jpg\" alt=\"1233076_10151786899149487_813971599_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/1009055_10151786901059487_2131602560_o.jpg\" alt=\"1009055_10151786901059487_2131602560_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904196,"PostDate":1441471580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, NG1515 and Congrats on your upcoming dw next April!!! You'll find lots of great resources here for ideas, advice, suggestions and support, so well done on joining up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope you find a great resolution for your conflict that turns out to be a win\/win all around.<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best with your plans, and that it turns out to be just as Awesome as you want it to be - cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....for some added inspiration, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera - to ramp up your creativity....enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>.....taken from one of our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151786897419487.1073741864.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Playa del Carmen TTD Albums: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1149138_10151786898754487_1301415691_o.jpg\" alt=\"1149138_10151786898754487_1301415691_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1233076_10151786899149487_813971599_o.jpg\" alt=\"1233076_10151786899149487_813971599_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/1009055_10151786901059487_2131602560_o.jpg\" alt=\"1009055_10151786901059487_2131602560_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1441663195,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78dc854c50e223851a188e0deb987ab5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Have you gotten your travel agent involved? &amp;nbsp;If they book enough volume with the resort they should be able to push the issue up the food chain.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904282,"PostDate":1441662640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have you gotten your travel agent involved? \u00a0If they book enough volume with the resort they should be able to push the issue up the food chain.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.11.189.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4d5ca98459b4616e679b084019f8e98","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"NG1515\"].....I had a similar situation happen with the Royalton White Sands in Jamaica......I ultimately searched for another resort in the area and moved my wedding to the other resort.&amp;nbsp; And this happened in May of this year, my wedding is in 4 weeks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had to have my travel agent move all of the reservations to the new resort.&amp;nbsp; Luckily, the room rates were the same and my guests did not have to pay more.&amp;nbsp; I sent out wedding update cards with the new location and an explanation on the back.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It was a lot of work but my travel agent was the greatest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did request a refund from the Royalton White Sands and they did honor it since it was their mistake, I had verification of my locations for the ceremony and receptions which they booked another wedding at the same time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so sorry you are going through this and I definitely understand the stress that it causes.&amp;nbsp; I hope you are able to get this resolved.&amp;nbsp; If you need any advice, feel free to message me. ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904284,"PostDate":1441676779,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284683\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284683-ng1515\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NG1515<\/span><\/a>.....I had a similar situation happen with the Royalton White Sands in Jamaica......I ultimately searched for another resort in the area and moved my wedding to the other resort.\u00a0 And this happened in May of this year, my wedding is in 4 weeks.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had to have my travel agent move all of the reservations to the new resort.\u00a0 Luckily, the room rates were the same and my guests did not have to pay more.\u00a0 I sent out wedding update cards with the new location and an explanation on the back.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It was a lot of work but my travel agent was the greatest.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did request a refund from the Royalton White Sands and they did honor it since it was their mistake, I had verification of my locations for the ceremony and receptions which they booked another wedding at the same time.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so sorry you are going through this and I definitely understand the stress that it causes.\u00a0 I hope you are able to get this resolved.\u00a0 If you need any advice, feel free to message me. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.54.249.196","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c432b9bc42b792af098b3948f521ada","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I am happy to report that we actually got everything straightened out! &amp;nbsp;After the initial shock of what happened and the effect it would have on our wedding, the resort and its team were extremely helpful, understood the stress associated with the change and we were able to move forward past this issue and get back to planning our special day. &amp;nbsp;The Romance Department came through and we were very pleased with and thankful for the attention they gave to resolving this issue. &amp;nbsp;Our wedding will now be the next day on April 17th which hopefully won&#039;t impact too many of our guests. &amp;nbsp;We are both just extremely happy to put that all behind us and can honestly say that we have been impressed with the manner in which the resort and the Romance Department handled this matter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905194,"PostDate":1442939359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I am happy to report that we actually got everything straightened out! \u00a0After the initial shock of what happened and the effect it would have on our wedding, the resort and its team were extremely helpful, understood the stress associated with the change and we were able to move forward past this issue and get back to planning our special day. \u00a0The Romance Department came through and we were very pleased with and thankful for the attention they gave to resolving this issue. \u00a0Our wedding will now be the next day on April 17th which hopefully won't impact too many of our guests. \u00a0We are both just extremely happy to put that all behind us and can honestly say that we have been impressed with the manner in which the resort and the Romance Department handled this matter.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nelsygomez15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.249.196","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441393839,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284683.jpg?_r=1441394632","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NG1515","Id":284683,"Name":"NG1515","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79565","Title":"Newbie - Already Having Wedding Drama With Paradisus Pdc","LastPostDate":1442939359},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
