?&amp;nbsp; Looks like they are scheduled to open in Nov 2011.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.paradisusplayadelcarmen.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.paradisusplayadelcarmen.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was looking into the Paradisus in Punta Cana but when I ran across there new resorts I was floored.&amp;nbsp; They look amazing!&amp;nbsp; Any 2012-2013 brides look into weddings here?&amp;nbsp; I would assume the packages would be similar to PPC.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1495597,"PostDate":1311975055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just curious if anyone has looked into the new Paradisus resorts being built in Playa del Carmen?\u00a0 Looks like they are scheduled to open in Nov 2011.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.paradisusplayadelcarmen.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.paradisus...adelcarmen.com\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was looking into the Paradisus in Punta Cana but when I ran across there new resorts I was floored.\u00a0 They look amazing!\u00a0 Any 2012-2013 brides look into weddings here?\u00a0 I would assume the packages would be similar to PPC.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri.cornell@bankofamerica.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309895515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241983.jpg?_r=1411575568","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":191,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriCornell","Id":241983,"Name":"KerriCornell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"267f96d71042200c5fce7b1123bfc4d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Kerri, My travel agent just emailed me today about this resort. She is going down for the grand opening at the end of the month and I will have more details then. I was so excited about the location and the fact that&#039;s its new (might be able to get some good pricing). I&#039;d be happy to share the info with you. I will also do a site visit sometime in Jan-Feb to see it for myself. I&#039;m not sure if you already booked, let me know!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543749,"PostDate":1320690186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Kerri, My travel agent just emailed me today about this resort. She is going down for the grand opening at the end of the month and I will have more details then. I was so excited about the location and the fact that's its new (might be able to get some good pricing). I'd be happy to share the info with you. I will also do a site visit sometime in Jan-Feb to see it for myself. I'm not sure if you already booked, let me know!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lildior1113@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"199.107.16.121","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315942310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245272.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisdior","Id":245272,"Name":"chrisdior","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6302013dc277ddbc95c51614d7e3591c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Girls!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I too am interested too if you have any info...we will be doing our site visit in Jan...Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543828,"PostDate":1320700779,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Girls!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I too am interested too if you have any info...we will be doing our site visit in Jan...Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danayjauregui@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.176.38.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1306867937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240613.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sophia2616","Id":240613,"Name":"Sophia2616","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30f5766402b743e4b96f215a3867d4bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am interested too! Let me know what she tells you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1552456,"PostDate":1322739368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am interested too! Let me know what she tells you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurenrosa80@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312920147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243598.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"picolinaqt","Id":243598,"Name":"picolinaqt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9016de9e59072a95d6ea591ca556687","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi!&amp;nbsp; If any of you are interested, the new resort Paradisus la Perla &amp;nbsp;is officially open and is amazing!&amp;nbsp; I have my honeymoon booked there in april 2012.&amp;nbsp; My travel manager is&amp;nbsp;great and can find&amp;nbsp;super deals fot you and your guests!!!!!!&amp;nbsp; If you are interested, let me know!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; here is the website:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.paradisuslaperla.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.paradisuslaperla.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1555695,"PostDate":1323501272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi!\u00a0 If any of you are interested, the new resort Paradisus la Perla \u00a0is officially open and is amazing!\u00a0 I have my honeymoon booked there in april 2012.\u00a0 My travel manager is\u00a0great and can find\u00a0super deals fot you and your guests!!!!!!\u00a0 If you are interested, let me know!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> here is the website:<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.paradisuslaperla.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.paradisuslaperla.com\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tashatemple.bc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1323500563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248504.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriabride2b","Id":248504,"Name":"victoriabride2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee0111b5b887d87e09b9a9aad8df4414","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m going in January to check it out. They offer the same \"Love at First site\" package that the other Paradisus resorts do. It&#039;s tailored for engaged couples looking for a wedding destination. They offer 3 days at a reduced rate, with&amp;nbsp;a tour of all the wedding facilities. If we book our wedding, the cost of the January trip will be deducted from our wedding cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ll will say that so far the Wedding department&amp;nbsp;has not&amp;nbsp;been very professional. It took multiple calls and emails to finally get the information I was looking for (their website only lists the Dominican Republic prices.) They&amp;nbsp;are nice, but don&#039;t seem very organized. Hopefully I will get a better impression in person.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ll keep you posted.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556399,"PostDate":1323730923,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm going in January to check it out. They offer the same \"Love at First site\" package that the other Paradisus resorts do. It's tailored for engaged couples looking for a wedding destination. They offer 3 days at a reduced rate, with\u00a0a tour of all the wedding facilities. If we book our wedding, the cost of the January trip will be deducted from our wedding cost.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I'll will say that so far the Wedding department\u00a0has not\u00a0been very professional. It took multiple calls and emails to finally get the information I was looking for (their website only lists the Dominican Republic prices.) They\u00a0are nice, but don't seem very organized. Hopefully I will get a better impression in person.<\/p> <p> I'll keep you posted.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwayslaughxoxo@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323730477,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248582.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kateh31","Id":248582,"Name":"kateh31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9291c19e25a0c91c84327c189779498","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I would like any informatio that you were able to get please.&amp;nbsp; It is intriguing that it is new.&amp;nbsp; Looking for a place for July 2012.&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:briannettu@msn.com\"&gt;briannettu@msn.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1559644,"PostDate":1324677020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I would like any informatio that you were able to get please.\u00a0 It is intriguing that it is new.\u00a0 Looking for a place for July 2012.\u00a0 <a href='mailto:briannettu@msn.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>briannettu@msn.com<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"briannettu@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1324415841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":142,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"briannettu","Id":248788,"Name":"briannettu","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51f12f4d02e92279b5f1ae68e16e7f77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am deciding between the new Paradisus and Azul Sensatori for a 2013 wedding. My FI and I area going to look at both sites this june. So far Paradisus has been very hard to coordinate with so hopefully after things settle down with the opening they get the kinks worked out. Let me know if anyone finds out any other information aside from what the site provides!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1561708,"PostDate":1325309013,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am deciding between the new Paradisus and Azul Sensatori for a 2013 wedding. My FI and I area going to look at both sites this june. So far Paradisus has been very hard to coordinate with so hopefully after things settle down with the opening they get the kinks worked out. Let me know if anyone finds out any other information aside from what the site provides!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelpitzen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1316976107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245837.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"birdie1119","Id":245837,"Name":"birdie1119","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"badc302a9ed2b52f9725cd0fca3f6034","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Please let us know what you find out on the site inspection and visit!!!!!&amp;nbsp; Oh and pictures...lots of pictures!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Still looking at this resort for a possible wedding May\/June.&amp;nbsp; I just noticed their prices have reduced a bit which is helpful.&amp;nbsp; Looking at staying on the La Perla side.&amp;nbsp; Anyone know if guests can stay at either side and still attend the wedding?   Are the wedding package prices the same as you see for Paradisus Punta Cana and Palma Real?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Kerri&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1562888,"PostDate":1325615571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Please let us know what you find out on the site inspection and visit!!!!!\u00a0 Oh and pictures...lots of pictures!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Still looking at this resort for a possible wedding May\/June.\u00a0 I just noticed their prices have reduced a bit which is helpful.\u00a0 Looking at staying on the La Perla side.\u00a0 Anyone know if guests can stay at either side and still attend the wedding?\u00a0\u00a0 Are the wedding package prices the same as you see for Paradisus Punta Cana and Palma Real?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!!!!!<\/p> <p> Kerri<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri.cornell@bankofamerica.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309895515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241983.jpg?_r=1411575568","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":191,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriCornell","Id":241983,"Name":"KerriCornell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef051c18944a0523a252a01554ea6301","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m also interested in hearing about weddings at Paradisus Playa del Carmen.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1564675,"PostDate":1325876781,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm also interested in hearing about weddings at Paradisus Playa del Carmen.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jules_nelson@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325803069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249407.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jules2012","Id":249407,"Name":"jules2012","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"62583","Title":"The new Paradisus Playa del Carmen (La Perla and La Esmeralda)","LastPostDate":1451775114},"Pages":{"TotalItems":718,"TotalPages":72,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":710},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
